# govinfo BILLSTATUS bill corpus + federal vote/speech edge feeds (~106K bills +
# floor-speech and roll-call edge JSONL for 113-119; large + regenerable). The
# run's provenance (manifest.json, ingest_meta.json) is tracked; the heavy
# artifacts (*.jsonl, *.log, donor_profiles.json) are not.
data/exports/govinfo_bills/*.jsonl
data/exports/govinfo_bills/*.log
data/exports/govinfo_bills/donor_profiles.json
data/exports/markets/
data/exports/municipal/
# LOCUS-v1 ordinance corpus (large regenerable artifacts; sample+manifest tracked)
